### Créer un brouillon de réponse dans le fil
POST {{GRAPH_BASE_URL}}/users/{{USER_ID_OR_UPN}}/messages/{{MESSAGE_ID}}/createReply
Authorization: Bearer {{GRAPH_ACCESS_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json
Prefer: outlook.timezone="{{DEFAULT_TIMEZONE}}"

{
  "message": {
    "body": {
      "contentType": "HTML",
      "content": "{{DRAFT_HTML}}"
    }
  }
}
